{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o108a","title":"孙权围合肥新城陆逊诸葛瑾屯江夏沔口孙韶张承向广陵淮阴","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o108a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙权围合肥新城陆逊诸葛瑾屯江夏沔口孙韶张承向广陵淮阴","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"围城","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"出军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0002","role":"出军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0037","role":"出军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0035","role":"出军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":234,"label":"夏五月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y234","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o107","basis":"夏五月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q","wuzhu-q-o107","zhuge-q-o039","zhuge-q-b-934abed655148ea08df3"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o108a-q","source_order":[47,559,"O108a"],"related_events":[{"event":"mingdi-e-o039b","type":"related","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q","mingdi-e-o039b-q"]}],"order":8319},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o063a","title":"张承论鲁淑当远到","accounts":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o063a-account","label":"《周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传》正文","text":"濡须督张承称既壮的鲁淑终当远到。","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o063a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhouyu-p0035","role":"论才","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o063a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"鲁淑既壮","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o063a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-o063a-q","source_order":[54,285,"O063a"],"order":9668}],"persons":[{"id":"zhouyu-p0035","name":"张承（吴濡须督）","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o063","wuzhu-q-o108","luxun-q-o083","luxun-q-b-a7d35cde220c2b309df4"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhouyu-m-o063-zhouyu-p0035","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o063"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o108-zhouyu-p0035","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o108"]},{"id":"luxun-m-o083-zhouyu-p0035","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o083","luxun-q-b-a7d35cde220c2b309df4"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-q-b-a7d35cde220c2b309df4","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-a7d35cde220c2b309df4","layer":"modern","quote":"〖27〗张承（公元 178—244）：传附本书卷五十二《张昭传》。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":451,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-50f36a846c6f45b0cb4a","start":0,"end":33},{"id":"luxun-q-o083","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-ef5b34254d0aade8edb3","layer":"original","quote":"景字士仁。以尚公主拜骑都尉，封毗陵侯。既领抗兵，拜偏将军，中夏督〖23〗。澡身好学〖24〗，著书数十篇也。﹝一﹞二月壬戌〖25〗，晏为王濬别军所杀；癸亥〖26〗，景亦遇害，时年三十一。景妻，孙皓嫡妹，与景俱张承外孙也〖27〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":423,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":116},{"id":"mingdi-e-o039b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5bf6d1ed2ab463eadb39","layer":"original","quote":"五月，太白昼现。孙权入居巢湖口〖1〗，向合肥新城〖2〗；又遣将陆议、孙韶各将万余人入淮、沔〖3〗。六月，征东将军满宠进军拒之〖4〗。宠欲拔新城守〖5〗，致贼寿春〖6〗。帝不听，曰：“昔汉光武遣兵悬据略阳〖7〗，终以破隗嚣〖8〗。先帝东置合肥，南守襄阳，西固祁山〖9〗；贼来辄破于三城之下者〖10〗，地有所必争也。纵权攻新城，必不能拔；敕诸将坚守，吾将自往征之；比至，恐权走也。”","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":189},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o108a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8d6d7b03ef7e78c66434","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，权遣陆逊、诸葛瑾等屯江夏、沔口〖5〗；孙韶、张承等向广陵、淮（阳）〔阴〕〖6〗；权率大众，围合肥新城。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o107","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-adeefad7184b459985c1","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“兵久不辍，民困于役，岁或不登〖2〗。其宽诸逋〖3〗，勿复督课〖4〗。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o108","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8d6d7b03ef7e78c66434","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，权遣陆逊、诸葛瑾等屯江夏、沔口〖5〗；孙韶、张承等向广陵、淮（阳）〔阴〕〖6〗；权率大众，围合肥新城。是时蜀相诸葛亮出武功〖7〗，权谓魏明帝不能远出；而帝遣兵助司马宣王拒亮〖8〗，自率水军东征。未至寿春，权退还，孙韶亦罢。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":115},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o063a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-0cf78368d23dcd7e3c85","layer":"original","quote":"肃遗腹子淑。既壮〖19〗，濡须督张承谓终当〔远〕到（至）〖20〗。永安中，为昭武将军〖21〗，都亭侯，武昌督。建衡中，假节，迁夏口督。所在严整，有方干〖22〗。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":284,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":80},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o063","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-0cf78368d23dcd7e3c85","layer":"original","quote":"肃遗腹子淑。既壮〖19〗，濡须督张承谓终当〔远〕到（至）〖20〗。永安中，为昭武将军〖21〗，都亭侯，武昌督。建衡中，假节，迁夏口督。所在严整，有方干〖22〗。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":284,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":80},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-934abed655148ea08df3","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-934abed655148ea08df3","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗十二年：建兴十二年（公元 234）。以上诸葛亮出兵北伐共计五次，经由祁山只有两次。后世所说的“六出祁山”并非历史真实。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":269,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1e22705f935572994567","start":0,"end":62},{"id":"zhuge-q-o039","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e60db7c722cd4fe4fb69","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春〖2〗，亮悉大众由斜谷出，以流马运；据武功五丈原〖3〗，与司马宣王对于渭南〖4〗。亮每患粮不继，使己志不申；是以分兵屯田，为久驻之基。耕者杂于渭滨居民之间，而百姓安堵〖5〗，军无私焉〖6〗。﹝三﹞相持百余日。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
